# Conversation face assets (pending user art)

When the user supplies face images, place them under:

`athena/src/domains/chat/face-assets/`

Use **these exact filenames** (PNG preferred, same canvas size e.g. 512×512 or 1024×1024):

## Emotion stills
- `idle.png`
- `happy.png`
- `sad.png`
- `angry.png`
- `concerned.png`
- `surprised.png`
- `thinking.png`
- `listening.png`
- `curious.png`
- `neutral.png` (optional alias of idle)

## Talking cycle (cycle while speaking)
- `speaking-01.png`
- `speaking-02.png`
- `speaking-03.png`
- (optional) `speaking-04.png` … `speaking-06.png`

Wire via `YesManFace` / a future `ImageFace` mapper from `AthenaEmotion` → file; speaking emotions cycle `speaking-01…N`.
